**Subject:** Fewer miles, same deliveries?

Hi {{First name}},

Most ops teams I speak to at logistics companies the size of {{Company}} are dealing with the same squeeze: fuel and driver costs keep rising, customers expect tighter delivery windows, and planners spend hours each day rebuilding routes by hand.

{{Product name}} automates that planning. It builds optimised routes in minutes, adjusts them in real time when orders, traffic or drivers change, and works alongside the systems you already use. Teams typically see {{result, e.g. "10–20% fewer miles driven"}} within the first few weeks.

Would you be open to a 15-minute call to see whether it could make a difference for {{Company}}? If it's not a fit, I'll say so.

Best regards,
{{Your name}}
SDR, {{Company name}}
{{Phone}} | {{Website}}

